### 1. JWT 토큰 커스터마이저 (OAuth2TokenCustomizer)
```java
@Component
public class JwtTokenCustomizer implements OAuth2TokenCustomizer<JwtEncodingContext> {

    @Override
    public void customize(JwtEncodingContext context) {
        if (OAuth2TokenType.ACCESS_TOKEN.equals(context.getTokenType())) {
            context.getClaims().claims(claims -> {
                // 커스텀 클레임 추가
                if (context.getPrincipal() instanceof UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken) {
                    CustomUserDetails userDetails = 
                        (CustomUserDetails) context.getPrincipal().getPrincipal();
                    User user = userDetails.getUser();

                    claims.put("username", user.getUsername());
                    claims.put("email", user.getEmail());
                    claims.put("user_id", user.getId());
                }

                // 권한 정보 추가
                Set<String> authorities = context.getAuthorizedScopes();
                claims.put("authorities", authorities);
            });
        }

        if (OidcParameterNames.ID_TOKEN.equals(context.getTokenType().getValue())) {
            context.getClaims().claims(claims -> {
                if (context.getPrincipal().getPrincipal() instanceof CustomUserDetails) {
                    CustomUserDetails userDetails = 
                        (CustomUserDetails) context.getPrincipal().getPrincipal();
                    User user = userDetails.getUser();

                    claims.put("name", user.getUsername());
                    claims.put("email", user.getEmail());
                    claims.put("preferred_username", user.getUsername());
                }
            });
        }
    }
}
```

### 2. Authorization Code Grant 흐름
```
1. 클라이언트 → Authorization Server
   GET /oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=test-client
       &redirect_uri=http://localhost:8080/callback
       &scope=openid profile email&state=xyz

2. 사용자 인증 및 동의

